// Service worker: makes the app installable and lets it run offline.
//
// All app files are cached together as one version (CACHE), so an installed app never mixes old and new modules.
// A new version is downloaded in the background when sw.js changes; the page offers a reload to switch to it.
// The file list and version below are generated by `python tools/build_sw.py` (serve.py runs it on start):
// run it after changing, adding or removing app files, before deploying.
//
// On localhost the network is tried first, so edits show up on reload during development.

